    "A fast, native Twitch client. Browse live channels, watch streams, and chat — without the bloat." : {

    },
    "A subscription still goes to your streamer and unlocks their emotes and badges, even though it can't remove ads inside Embr. If ad-free viewing is what you're after, the official Twitch app honors your Turbo subscription." : {

